    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d252-a3">

                <pb facs="0652" n="566" sameAs="frus:frus1873p1v1/pg566"/>

                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Notification.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps">United
                                States Legation</hi></placeName>,<lb/><date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1872-12-23"><hi rendition="#italic">December</hi> 23,
                        1872</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>The undersigned publishes, for the information of his countrymen in Japan, the
                    following letter, received by him on the 20th instant, with an accompanying
                    proclamation by the public works department.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>C. E. DE LONG,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">United States
                        Minister.</hi></signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
